76561198311621765", "personaname": "Promatag", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/promatag/", "num_games_owned": 510, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 12061, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8488, "last_played": 1767755920, "avatar": "0e96fd1da4c91017a7c1de980d6361b139e6831d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just 100%'d this game\n\nAs of writing, GearBox has released the first of their updates to remedy the faults of Seekers of the Storm. \n\nMost people would recommend this game by default, but a disagreement has come up in recent times whether its worth recommending this, given the change in ownership and the turbulent release of the new DLC. \n\nI will recommend it. While the DLC launch was messy, to say the least, it seems GearBox is more than dedicated to fix these problems. As stated earlier, their first of these remedial updates have released, which i believe to be very promising.\n\nI'd be willing to say that the game is now in good hands, and I'm willing to wait and see what GearBox's team has to offer.", "timestamp_created": 1733009037, "timestamp_updated": 1733972944, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "181184333", "author": {"steamid": "76561198022559208", "personaname": "J0KER", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/yajith/", "num_games_owned": 527, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 17131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15602, "last_played": 1775194637, "avatar": "43aff92d54511212f1aa776289a34d4161b0c523"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game to play solo or co-op, well worth the $$$. Picking up various items and seeing your character become very powerful is quite fun and going for various achievements have been fun (for the most part except for a very few ridiculous achievements that are just based on random chance) \n\nLatest DLC doesn't seem to fit in well with the established theme, however the Devs seem to be actively working to sort out the issues, so I'd still recommend this to anyone wanting to give this a go.. you might find it quite enjoyable - just like I did.", "timestamp_created": 1733008369, "timestamp_updated": 1745371831, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "181181709", "author": {"steamid": "76561199074380715", "personaname": "Mercy_Kill", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199074380715/", "num_games_owned": 139, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 25045, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21696, "last_played": 1787884144, "avatar": "39f6aab7871c9bcda1c3b269ce4b2288d3ba0307"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the Best Rogue-Like, I've ever played", "timestamp_created": 1733007780, "timestamp_updated": 1733007780, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}